{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04557","headline":"赠崔公 · 张说","name":"赠崔公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我闻西汉日，四老南山幽。\n长歌紫芝秀，高卧白云浮。\n朝野光尘绝，榛芜年貌秋。\n一朝驱驷马，连辔入龙楼。\n昔遯高皇去，今从太子游。\n行藏惟圣节，福祸在人谋。\n卒能匡惠帝，岂不赖留侯。\n事随年代远，名与图籍留。\n平生钦淳德，慷慨景前修。\n蜯蛤伺阴兔，蛟龙望斗牛。\n无嗟异飞伏，同气幸相求。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04557.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04557","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}